# Hyper-V Lab — ASP.NET Core Web App, IIS, SQL Server Authentication & Troubleshooting

## 1. Project Overview

### Objective

Build and troubleshoot a small Windows-based infrastructure environment using Hyper-V, Active Directory, SQL Server Express, and an ASP.NET Core web application.

The main learning goals were:

- Deploy and test a web application.
- Connect the web application to SQL Server.
- Understand Windows Authentication and SQL Server permissions.
- Troubleshoot administrative access to SQL Server.
- Understand the difference between running an application with Kestrel and hosting it with IIS.
- Verify network connectivity between virtual machines.

